{"pin":"BH00264","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00264","anchor":"","first_line":"This is the Book sent down from before God, the Protector, the Self-Subsisting. Verily it is a Book which, when it appeared, made manifest the ocean and its waves [3.5s]... ...Praise be unto Thee, O my God, in that Thou hast revealed to me Thy signs, hast made Thine indubitable proofs manifest…  Praise be to Thee, O my God, inasmuch as Thou hast given me to drink from the cup of Thy bounty, adorned me with the raiment of Thy knowledge","first_line_orig":"کتاب مرقوم نزل من لدی الله المهیمن القیوم انه لکتاب اذ ظهر ظهر البحر و امواجه  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"2420","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15724.136","source":"BLIB_Or15724","locator":"136"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM3#047 p.060x","source":"ADM3","locator":"047 p.060x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/559.pdf#page=61"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM3#048 p.061x","source":"ADM3","locator":"048 p.061x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/559.pdf#page=62"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM3#049 p.062x","source":"ADM3","locator":"049 p.062x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/559.pdf#page=63"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#338","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"338","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/877363967"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MSBH2.056x","source":"MSBH2","locator":"056x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/248.pdf#page=26"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#086x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"086x","url":"https://joshuahalltranslations.com/jalal/2017/10/Supplications-by-Bahaullah-1.pdf#page=40"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#145x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"145x","url":"https://joshuahalltranslations.com/jalal/2017/10/Supplications-by-Bahaullah-1.pdf#page=65"}]},{"code":"BH00264IND","anchor":"ind","translations":[{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"language":"th","lang_name":"Thai"},{"language":"srn","